{"ID":"20240118151201-dbhbpkr","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151201-dbhbpkr","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151201-dbhbpkr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151201-r4frzzs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122122118-6ryv8cl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122122103-rib8293\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:28,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:28\u0026#125;","title":"151孔公孽152殷孽","type":"doc","updated":"20240131102313"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151201-r4frzzs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151201-r4frzzs","updated":"20240122122103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"孔公孽"}]},{"ID":"20240122122103-rib8293","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122103-rib8293","updated":"20240131102313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛温，主伤食不化，邪结气，恶创疽瘘痔，利九窍，下乳汁。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122122108-dq5orik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122108-dq5orik","updated":"20240122122112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"殷孽"}]},{"ID":"20240122122113-vjy4bre","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122113-vjy4bre","updated":"20240122122117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛温主烂伤瘀血泄利寒热鼠瘘症瘕结气，今少用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122122117-hf3fqcj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122117-hf3fqcj"}},{"ID":"20240122122118-ndb2i61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122118-ndb2i61"}},{"ID":"20240122122118-6ryv8cl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122122118-6ryv8cl","updated":"20240131102304"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"151和152，这个孔公孽和殷孽，这两个我们很少用，现在已经几乎没有人用它了，那这两个不是很重要的，当然你们可以把它找出来，然后可以使用它，这个倒没有什么，因为它出在《神农本草经》，为什么我们会没有用，不是它不好，而是说我们比有它更好的药在用，所以张仲景也没有用它。"}]}]}